{"2908090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "VITRIOL", "steam_appid": 2908090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908090/extras/c6f4d3849a573427befd8572b2ddbacd.avif?t=1785215639\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908090/extras_big/c6f4d3849a573427befd8572b2ddbacd.webp?t=1785215639 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Movement Shooter REIMAGINED!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shooter mechanics new &amp; old have been retooled &amp; reimagined for <i>Virtual Reality.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using familiar <i><strong>Physics</strong></i> as a tool to build <strong>New Features</strong> that capture the <strong>Old Rush</strong> of a demon below your Iron</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908090/extras/8ce19f4270a80300f6290e5a1c7b53c3.poster.avif?t=1785215639\" width=360 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908090/extras/8ce19f4270a80300f6290e5a1c7b53c3.webm?t=1785215639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908090/extras/8ce19f4270a80300f6290e5a1c7b53c3.mp4?t=1785215639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Elbows Unlocked!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Torque based <i>Physics Arms</i> &amp; <i>Advanced Elbow Estimation</i> <u><i><strong>YOU</strong></i></u> can larp upper body tracking with <u><i><strong>any</strong></i></u> headset &amp; its two motion controllers. </p><